p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >饥饿</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >雨夜</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >拉面蒸汽</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无人机</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >电流声</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >被监控的人生</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >以及：</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“仍想活下去的人类”。</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >游戏内容</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >剧情探索</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >黑客潜入</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无人机躲避</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >卡车运输</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >卡牌策略玩法</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >赛博朋克城市探索</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC互动</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多角色叙事</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >记忆空间关卡</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >动态天气与昼夜系统</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >电影式演出</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >灵感来源</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《银翼杀手2049》</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《攻壳机动队》</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《赛博朋克2077》</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《死亡搁浅》</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《如龙》</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >九龙城寨</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战后东京下町文化</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >成人内容描述</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本游戏包含：</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >暴力描写</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战后社会题材</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >血腥场景</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >赛博朋克社会压迫元素</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >心理与存在主义主题</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >最后的问题</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >如果人类的记忆可以被上传……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >那么：</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >“灵魂”</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >是否也会一同留下？</p>", "short_description": "影像图文互动小说游戏概述 一款暗黑赛博反乌托邦影像图文互动小说，融合剧情短片、场景原画与文字叙事。玩家化身黑客小林明日香，游走关东灰色街区，寻找被制为灵矿的弟弟；点击场景交互收集神经设备、意识硬盘，和黑市商贩、舰队高层周旋谈判，登录暗网拼接破碎记忆，解锁专属剧情 CG，每一次选择都会改写故事走向。巨型财阀天照打着 “数字永生” 幌子掠夺人类意识，将灵魂当作商品交易，是全篇核心矛盾。故事交织逃亡司机、复仇者、军政多方势力，提供潜入取证、舆论曝光、武装对抗三条行动路线，设有多重独立结局。玩家在层层线索追查与艰难抉择中，体会底层小人物对抗资本巨兽、追寻亲人残魂的挣扎与悲怆", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4720880/9b7b1bd53dc40d44084d104f9d5b80d9124a20e3/header.jpg?t=1788136524", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4720880/207bffcef925e12f0075590278fc2efd5905bd5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788136524", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4720880/207bffcef925e12f0075590278fc2efd5905bd5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788136524", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 或 AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti 或 AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 需要 64 位处理器和操作系统。</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 或 AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 或 AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 需要 64 位处理器和操作系统。</li></ul>"}, "mac_req